        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Can you believe it's been **three** years since the last Sidekick update? With all that's been happening in the world of Sentinels, we decided it was time to kick the tires and freshen it up.\n\nIntroducing Sentinels Sidekick **3.0** - [now available on the App Store!](https://apps.apple.com/us/app/sentinels-sidekick/id525436193) It supports all **three** of the Sentinels core games:\n\n* Sentinels of the Multiverse: **Definitive Edition**\n* Sentinels of **Earth-Prime**\n* Sentinels of the Multiverse **(Enhanced Edition)**\n\nHigh resolution official artwork and nemesis icons for both new core games are **included** at no additional cost.\n\n[Read more about it on our blog!](https://www.handelabra.com/blog/2022/6/8/sentinels-sidekick-turns-three)",
